<header class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="#top">Divya Parashar</a><nav class="links" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#experience">Experience</a><a href="#skills">Skills</a><a href="#work">Selected work</a><a class="cta" href="#contact">Contact</a></nav></header>
<main id="top"><section class="wrap hero"><div class="eyebrow">HR · Talent Acquisition · People Operations</div><h1>Recruiting with care.<br><em>People operations</em> with clarity.</h1><p class="lead">I’m Divya, an HR and Talent Acquisition professional supporting domestic and U.S. hiring, candidate experience, onboarding, and employee engagement.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="#experience">Explore my experience</a><a class="button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/divya-parashar-ta/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn</a></div><div class="meta"><span>Gurugram, India</span><span>Open to HR & Talent Acquisition opportunities</span></div></section>
<section id="about" class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">About me</div><h2>People first, organized by design.</h2></div><p class="intro">I combine hands-on recruiting and HR operations with a thoughtful, candidate-centered approach. I enjoy keeping hiring workflows moving while making each interaction clear and respectful.</p></div><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="stat">Domestic + U.S.</div><p class="small">Recruiting across Product, Design, Technology, and Business roles, including coordination across U.S. time zones.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="stat">25+ new hires</div><p class="small">Onboarding and induction support at HCDS Technologies, from pre-boarding and first-day briefings to first-week follow-up.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="stat">BCA · AI & ML</div><p class="small">SGT University. Technical studies inform my interest in technology hiring and people operations.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="stat">How I work</div><p class="small">Clear communication, careful documentation, consistent follow-up, and a welcoming candidate and employee experience.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section id="experience" class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">Where I’ve contributed</div><h2>Experience</h2></div><p class="intro">A practical foundation in recruiting coordination, onboarding, and people operations.</p></div><div class="timeline">
<article class="job"><div class="date">Oct 2025 — Present<br><span class="small">Full-time · Gurugram</span></div><div><h3>HR & Operations Associate</h3><div class="company">Crossing Hurdles</div><ul><li>Support domestic and U.S. recruitment across Product, Design, Technology, and Business roles.</li><li>Source candidates using LinkedIn Recruiter, LinkedIn Global, Juicebox, Paraform, Naukri, and targeted Boolean and X-Ray searches.</li><li>Review applications, shortlist qualified profiles, coordinate interviews across U.S. time zones, and keep candidates informed.</li><li>Maintain candidate pipelines and status updates while partnering with hiring teams to calibrate profiles and move searches forward.</li></ul></div></article>
<article class="job"><div class="date">Apr 2025 — Sep 2025<br><span class="small">Internship · Gurugram</span></div><div><h3>People Inclusion & Onboarding Intern</h3><div class="company">HCDS Technologies</div><ul><li>Coordinated onboarding and induction for 25+ new hires, including pre-boarding, first-day briefings, and first-week support.</li><li>Supported trainee recruitment through sourcing, resume screening, candidate communication, interview coordination, and recruitment drives using LinkedIn and Unstop.</li><li>Maintained employee documentation, onboarding records, and HR reports; organized engagement activities that encouraged inclusion and team connection.</li></ul></div></article>
<article class="job"><div class="date">Jan 2025 — Mar 2025<br><span class="small">Internship · Remote</span></div><div><h3>Human Resources Intern</h3><div class="company">TechKnow Minds JS Global Solutions</div><ul><li>Supported recruitment and onboarding, employee engagement initiatives, and HR coordination.</li><li>Contributed to documentation, market research, and digital marketing and social media tasks.</li></ul></div></article>
</div></div></section>
<section id="skills" class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">What I bring</div><h2>Skills & tools</h2></div><p class="intro">Recruiting craft, reliable coordination, and the systems used to keep candidate and employee workflows organized.</p></div><div class="skills">
<article class="skill"><h3>Talent acquisition</h3><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Candidate sourcing</span><span class="tag">Resume screening</span><span class="tag">Boolean & X-Ray search</span><span class="tag">Technical recruiting</span><span class="tag">Interview coordination</span><span class="tag">Candidate experience</span><span class="tag">Pipeline management</span></div></article>
<article class="skill"><h3>People operations</h3><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Onboarding & induction</span><span class="tag">Employee engagement</span><span class="tag">People operations</span><span class="tag">HR documentation</span><span class="tag">Cross-functional coordination</span></div></article>
<article class="skill"><h3>Recruiting platforms</h3><div class="tags"><span class="tag">LinkedIn Recruiter</span><span class="tag">LinkedIn Global</span><span class="tag">Juicebox</span><span class="tag">Paraform</span><span class="tag">Naukri</span><span class="tag">Unstop</span></div></article>
<article class="skill"><h3>Ways of working</h3><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Clear candidate communication</span><span class="tag">Detail-oriented records</span><span class="tag">Timely follow-up</span><span class="tag">Inclusive mindset</span><span class="tag">Time-zone coordination</span></div></article></div></div></section>
<section id="work" class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">A glimpse of my work</div><h2>People and culture, in practice.</h2></div><p class="intro">Selected public posts about employee connection and my growth in the HR community.</p></div><div class="proof"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7515241123259256833/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><small>Employee engagement</small><strong>Why shared moments help colleagues feel like a team.</strong><b>Read the LinkedIn post ↗</b></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7510207730478084096/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><small>HR community & recognition</small><strong>Celebrating the people behind better workplaces.</strong><b>Read the LinkedIn post ↗</b></a></div></div></section>
